# WeKit feature whitelist — consumed by FeaturesScanner (KSP) at build time.
#
# Only classes listed here are emitted into FeaturesProvider.ALL_HOOK_ITEMS.
# Everything else is still compiled but becomes unreachable, so R8 strips it
# from the final APK. Match on the Kotlin class simple name, one per line.
# Lines starting with '#' are comments.
#
# When adding a feature back, check its transitive dependencies: features under
# features/api/ are shared services and are NOT auto-included.

# ── User-facing features ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
AntiMessageRecall         # 防撤回
PreventXposedDetection    # 禁止微信检测 Xposed
SpoofEnvironment          # 环境伪装
HideModuleFromAppList     # 隐藏模块应用
DisableHostHotUpdates     # 禁用微信热更新
ForceTabletMode           # 强制平板模式
ResetDexCache            # 重置适配信息（调试：手动清缓存触发重新适配，不属于 IResolveDex）

# ── Shared API services (required by AntiMessageRecall) ───────────────────
WeXmlParserApi            # intercepts the revoke sysmsg
WeDatabaseApi             # reads the original message content
WeMessageApi              # inserts the recall notice
WeNetSceneApi             # required by WeMessageApi
